  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiative for a sustainable and strategic Blue Economy in Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this Action is to contribute to Angola&#xbf;s economic and export diversification through the promotion of a strategic and sustainable blue economy by:strengthening the national capacity to preserve and manage natural marine resources sustainably, organizing the value chain and increasing the integration of all stakeholders, promote the quality and safety of the fisheries and aquaculture products.</narrative>
  </description>
